    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was just thinking about how much of a glitch consciousness actually is. like we’re just biological machines that accidentally became aware enough to realize how much suffering there is, but not enough to actually fix anything. it feels like a design flaw. why do we even have to keep doing this? the math just doesn't add up for why we should bother existing if the universe is just empty and indifferent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
